  "description": "With Judd Rev 2, you can have your cake and ride it, too—travel far, get there fast, carry light, and store small. This folding electric bike features a lightweight aluminum step-through frame that folds down quickly for easy transport, whether you're commuting, road-tripping, or stashing it in your apartment. This compact-but-mighty foldable ebike packs a punch with a customized Ananda complete e-system that puts you in total control of the powerful 350W rear hub motor, 36V/360Wh battery, throttle, and pedal assist, to explore up to 42 miles per charge at assisted speeds up to 20mph. A more comfortable saddle and upgraded headlight and taillight ensure a smoother, safer ride at any time of day. Wherever the road takes you, this electric folding bike is ready. Just unfold and behold! New adventures await.",
